                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<p>
   <lb n="1"/>799 śaka nu mrateñ vaidyaśiva jvan dravya phoṅ ta vraḥ ka-
   <lb n="2"/>mrateṅ Añ śrī vindhyeśvara miśrabhoga nuv Āśrama
   <lb n="3"/>ta vraḥ kaṁsteṅ Añ navaśukti I tmo ta gi 7 cancyān {1} ka-
   <lb n="4"/>nakadanda 3 bhājana 2 garop 2 mayūra I Āyoga {2}pā
   <lb n="5"/>prak I Āyoga moy ti ta gi kuṭī paṁnvas cya slā vaudī
   <lb n="6"/>caṁdoṅ prak 2 vaudī I padigaḥ I kadāha 3 svok 3
   <lb n="7"/>qnak ta paṁre kaṁnuṅ ka vraḥ dvār tmoṅ ghoda I tmoṅ Oṅ I chatra-
   <lb n="8"/>dhara kanpas I mahānasa candravāra I ch[ma]p ge devadāsa {1}
   <lb n="9"/>ma tai padmāpati I tai kandhū I tai la {8}
   <lb n="10"/>{5} tai saṁ {14}
</p>     
</div>                                              
